# Allowlist-by-default (denylist everything, then carve out what the
# image build actually needs) -- same discipline as lucid-attest's own
# .dockerignore for the signer image, applied here even though this image
# carries no trust-boundary constraint: a smaller, deliberate build
# context is still worth having on its own merits (faster builds, no
# accidental inclusion of test fixtures/caches/git history).
*

!cli
!cli/**
!schema
!schema/**
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
